flowchart TD
    A[Schizophrenia diagnosis and persistent symptoms] --> B[Treatment resistance status]
    C[Adequacy of prior antipsychotic trials] --> B
    D[Adherence evidence and trial response] --> B
    E[Residual impairment despite partial response] --> B

    F[Severe neutropenia, myocarditis, NMS, or urgent toxicity] --> G[Clozapine eligibility]
    H[Monitoring feasibility and patient preference] --> G
    I[Titration risk: older, debilitated, CNS risk, cardiovascular risk, respiratory depressants] --> J[Clozapine implementation mode]
    K[Clozapine current status: naive, interrupted, subtherapeutic, adequate nonresponse, responding] --> J

    B --> L[Clozapine priority]
    G --> L
    J --> M[Management recommendation]
    L --> M

    N[Catatonia, significant suicide risk, rapid response need, or clozapine-resistant illness] --> O[ECT priority]
    O --> M

    P[TMS considered for hallucinations or negative symptoms] --> Q[TMS priority]
    Q --> M

    M --> R[Recommended clinical action pattern]
